  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; background-color: #CCEEFF">
    <TD><A HREF="#drsp2_09">EXPENSES OF THE OFFERING</A></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: right">83</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>



