    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 8pt"><TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%"><TR><TD STYLE="text-align: left; width: 100%"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 8pt">&nbsp;<A HREF="#toc">Table of Contents</A></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<DIV STYLE="padding-right: 2%; padding-left: 2%; border: Black 1pt solid">

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">To better understand
    the terms of the Depositary Shares and the deposit agreement, including applicable fees and charges, you should carefully read &ldquo;<I>Description
    of American Depositary Shares</I>&rdquo; in this prospectus. You should also read the deposit agreement, which is an exhibit to the registration
    statement that includes this prospectus.</P></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>Depositary</B></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 26pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>Use of proceeds</B></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Assuming we sell all&nbsp;Units offered
    pursuant to this prospectus, we estimate the net proceeds from this offering will be approximately $ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;million (or approximately $ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;million
    if the underwriters exercise their over-allotment option in full), based on an assumed combined public offering price of $  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;per Unit with
    Depositary Shares (the last reported sale price of our Depositary Shares on the NASDAQ Capital Market on  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, 2025) and $ per Unit with Pre-Funded
    Warrants (the last reported sale price of our Depositary Shares on the NASDAQ Capital Market on  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, 2025, minus $0.0001), after deducting
    underwriting discounts and commissions and estimated offering expenses payable by us and excluding proceeds, if any, from the cash exercise
    of the Pre-Funded Warrants and Series L Warrants sold in this offering.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 26pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We intend to use the net proceeds from
    this offering to <FONT STYLE="background-color: white">fund our development programs, for working capital and other general corporate
    purposes. Pending other uses, we intend to invest the net proceeds to us in short-term, interest-bearing investments. We cannot predict
    whether the net proceeds invested will yield a favorable return. See &ldquo;<I>Use of Proceeds.</I>&rdquo;</FONT></P></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 26pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>Risk factors</B></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">An investment in our securities involves substantial risks. You should read the &ldquo;<I>Risk Factors</I>&rdquo; section starting on page <B>[&bull;]</B> of this prospectus, together with all of the other information included and incorporated by reference in this prospectus, before deciding to invest in our securities.</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="width: 39%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 60%">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; vertical-align: top"><B>Market and trading symbol</B></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Our Depositary Shares are listed on the NASDAQ Capital Market under the symbol &ldquo;BDRX.&rdquo;&nbsp;We do not intend to list the Pre-Funded Warrants or Series L Warrants on any securities exchange or national recognized trading system. Without a trading market, the liquidity of the Pre-Funded Warrants and Series L Warrants will be extremely limited.</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">The number of our Ordinary Shares to be outstanding
immediately after this offering is calculated based upon 25,617,408,922 Ordinary Shares outstanding as of April 1, 2025, and excludes
as of that date:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD>325,958,788 Ordinary Shares issuable upon the exercise of stock options outstanding under our equity incentive plans at a weighted-average
exercise price of &pound;0.005 per share;</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD>40 Ordinary Shares issuable upon the exercise of stock options in connection with the acquisition of DARA Bioscience, Inc. at a weighted
average exercise price of $824.80 per share;</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD>warrants, including pre-funded warrants, exercisable for 770,026 Depositary Shares (representing 7,700,260,000 Ordinary Shares), at
a weighted average exercise price of $38.42 per Depositary Share; and</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD>any warrants issuable in this offering.</TD></TR></TABLE>

