combined public offering price of $&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; per Unit, assuming (i) no sale of any Pre-Funded Units and (ii) no exercise of the Series L Warrants
and the Underwriter Warrants, after deducting the estimated underwriting discounts and commissions and estimated offering expenses.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The adjusted amounts shown
