net tangible book value per Depositary Share as of December 31, 2024</TD><TD STYLE="width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%; text-align: left">$</TD><TD STYLE="width: 15%; text-align: right">5.02</TD><TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; width: 1%; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
