  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 9pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 9pt"><P STYLE="margin-left: 18pt; padding-left: 9pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -18pt">Decrease to net tangible book value per
                                                                      Depositary Share attributable to investors purchasing our Depositary Shares in this offering</P></TD><TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left">$</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: right">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 9pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 9pt">As adjusted net tangible book value per Depositary Share as of December 31, 2024, after giving effect to this offering</TD><TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: left">$</TD><TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: right">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; padding-bottom: 1pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: left; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">Dilution per Depositary Share to the investors in this offering</TD><TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">$</TD><TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>



<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">A $ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;increase in the assumed
combined public offering price of $ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;per Unit would increase the as adjusted net tangible book value per Depositary Share by $ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;and increase
the dilution per Depositary Share to investors participating in this offering by $ , assuming no sale of any Pre-Funded Units and no exercise
of the Series L Warrants and Underwriter Warrants, and after deducting estimated underwriting discounts and commissions, and estimated
offering expenses payable by us. A $&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; decrease in the assumed combined public offering price of $&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; per Unit would decrease the as adjusted
net tangible book value per Depositary Share by $&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; and decrease the dilution per Depositary Share to investors participating in this offering
by $ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, assuming no sale of any Units containing Pre-Funded Warrants and no exercise of the Series L Warrants and Underwriter Warrants,
and after deducting estimated underwriting discounts and commissions, and estimated offering expenses payable by us.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">For purposes of this section,
the share information above excludes:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

