The warrants became exercisable on May 24, 2024. The Series G Warrants, Series H Warrants and&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="background-color: white">Warrant
Agent</FONT>&nbsp;Warrants expire five years, five years and three years, respectively from the initial exercise date. The holder shall
