<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white; color: #212529"><FONT STYLE="background-color: white">The
following is a brief summary of the Series J Warrants, Series K Warrants, and July 2024 Placement Agent Warrants, issued in connection
with a July 2024 private placement, and is subject in all respects to the provisions contained in the applicable warrants,&nbsp;</FONT>which
are filed as exhibits to our Report on Form 6-K dated July 19, 2024<FONT STYLE="background-color: white">. Unless otherwise stated, references
to &ldquo;warrants&rdquo; in this subsection include the Series J Warrants, Series K Warrants and July 2024 Placement Agent Warrants.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white; color: #212529"><I>Exercisability</I>.
